@host = http://localhost:5198

### Valid registration -> 201
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "anna@example.com",
  "password": "Passw0rd!",
  "firstName": "Anna",
  "lastName": "Hansen",
  "phoneNumber": "+4512345678"
}

### Missing fields -> 400 with one error per field
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Malformed email -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "password": "Passw0rd!",
  "firstName": "Anna",
  "lastName": "Hansen",
  "phoneNumber": "+4512345678"
}

### Phone without country code -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "bo@example.com",
  "password": "Passw0rd!",
  "firstName": "Bo",
  "lastName": "Jensen",
  "phoneNumber": "12345678"
}

### Weak password -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "bo@example.com",
  "password": "abc",
  "firstName": "Bo",
  "lastName": "Jensen",
  "phoneNumber": "+4512345678"
}

### Duplicate email (different letter case) -> 400, run after the first request
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ANNA@example.com",
  "password": "Passw0rd!",
  "firstName": "Anna",
  "lastName": "Hansen",
  "phoneNumber": "+4512345678"
}

### Login (use the email from the registration above) -> 200 and a session cookie
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "anna@example.com",
  "password": "Passw0rd!"
}

### Current user (the REST client sends the cookie from the login above) -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me

### Wrong password -> 401
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "anna@example.com",
  "password": "Wrong123!"
}

### Unknown email -> 401, identical to the wrong password response
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nobody@example.com",
  "password": "Passw0rd!"
}

### Login with missing fields -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{}
